{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":55,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. On stringed instruments. A contemplation by David."},{"n":1,"text":"Listen to my prayer, God. Don’t hide yourself from my supplication.","tok":[{"t":"Listen "},{"t":"to","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" prayer, God. Don’t hide yourself from "},{"t":"my","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" supplication."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Attend to me, and answer me. I am restless in my complaint, and moan","tok":[{"t":"Attend "},{"t":"to","s":["H8605"]},{"t":" me, "},{"t":"and","s":["H8605"]},{"t":" answer me. I am restless "},{"t":"in","s":["H8467"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H5956"]},{"t":" complaint, "},{"t":"and","s":["H8605"]},{"t":" moan"}]},{"n":3,"text":"because of the voice of the enemy, because of the oppression of the wicked. For they bring suffering on me. In anger they hold a grudge against me.","tok":[{"t":"because "},{"t":"of","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" voice "},{"t":"of","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" enemy, because "},{"t":"of","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" oppression "},{"t":"of","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" wicked. "},{"t":"For","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" they bring suffering on "},{"t":"me","s":["H6030"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"In","s":["H6030"]},{"t":" anger they hold "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" grudge against "},{"t":"me","s":["H6030"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"My heart is severely pained within me. The terrors of death have fallen on me.","tok":[{"t":"My","s":["H5921"],"a":[6]},{"t":" heart "},{"t":"is","s":["H7563"]},{"t":" severely pained "},{"t":"within","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H6440"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"The","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" terrors "},{"t":"of","s":["H6963"]},{"t":" death "},{"t":"have","s":["H7563"]},{"t":" fallen "},{"t":"on","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H6440"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Fearfulness and trembling have come o